---
import { YEARS, YEARS_WORD } from '../config/years';

interface Props {
  /** Heading tag for the section title — h1 on the dedicated page, h2 elsewhere. */
  headingLevel?: 'h1' | 'h2';
}
const { headingLevel = 'h2' } = Astro.props;
const Heading = headingLevel;
---

<section class="story section" id="story">
  <div class="container story__inner">
    <div class="story__visual">
      <div class="story__image story__image--main" data-image-reveal>
        <img
          src="/images/storefront-wide.jpg"
          alt="Carolina Fine Foods storefront in Simpsonville"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="story__image story__image--accent" data-image-reveal>
        <img
          src="/images/southern.jpg"
          alt="Authentic Southern cuisine plate"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="story__years" data-reveal>
        <span class="story__years-num">
          <span data-count={YEARS}>0</span>
        </span>
        <span class="story__years-label"
          >Years of<br />Southern<br />Hospitality</span
        >
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="story__content">
      <span class="eyebrow" data-reveal>Our Story</span>
      <Heading class="story__title" data-reveal-heading>
        Grandma&rsquo;s kitchen, kept alive for {YEARS_WORD} summers.
      </Heading>
      <div class="divider" data-reveal>
        <span></span>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"
          ><path
            d="M12 2l2.4 7.4H22l-6.2 4.5 2.4 7.4L12 16.8l-6.2 4.5 2.4-7.4L2 9.4h7.6z"
          ></path></svg
        >
        <span></span>
      </div>

      <p class="story__lead" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="0.1">
        Since 1983, our family has set the table the same way every morning
        &mdash; with hands that remember, recipes that were never written down,
        and a quiet kind of pride that only comes from feeding people you love,
        here in Simpsonville and across Greenville County.
      </p>

      <div class="story__columns" data-reveal-stagger>
        <div class="story__column">
          <div class="story__column-icon">
            <svg
              width="22"
              height="22"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.5"
              ><path d="M12 2v20M2 7s4 2 10 2 10-2 10-2M2 17s4-2 10-2 10 2 10 2"
              ></path></svg
            >
          </div>
          <h3>Passed down by you</h3>
          <p>
            Every recipe carries a name and a porch swing memory. The cornbread,
            the gravy, the slow-simmered beans &mdash; all gifts from the
            families of the Upstate, folks who&rsquo;ve driven in from Laurens
            to Pickens County for a seat at our table.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="story__column">
          <div class="story__column-icon">
            <svg
              width="22"
              height="22"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.5"
              ><path d="M12 22s8-7 8-13a8 8 0 10-16 0c0 6 8 13 8 13z"
              ></path><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="3"></circle></svg
            >
          </div>
          <h3>Made here, every day</h3>
          <p>
            Two hundred Southern dishes &mdash; prepared by hand each morning.
            No shortcuts, no shipped trays. Cleanliness and craft you can taste.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="story__column">
          <div class="story__column-icon">
            <svg
              width="22"
              height="22"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.5"
              ><path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2z"
              ></path><path d="M9 22V12h6v10"></path></svg
            >
          </div>
          <h3>A seat at the family table</h3>
          <p>
            Three private dining rooms, no upcharge for gathering. Bring the
            church group, the cousins, the in-laws &mdash; everyone fits.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <a href="/menu" class="story__more" data-reveal>
        Browse the menu
        <svg
          width="18"
          height="12"
          viewBox="0 0 18 12"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="1.5"
        >
          <path d="M1 6h16M12 1l5 5-5 5"></path>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .story {
    background: var(--color-bone);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .story__inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.1fr;
    gap: 6rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .story__visual {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 4/5;
  }

  .story__image {
    position: absolute;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-deep);
    border: 1px solid rgba(185, 145, 78, 0.18);
  }

  .story__image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .story__image--main {
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 78%;
    height: 78%;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .story__image--accent {
    bottom: 0;
    right: 0;
    width: 55%;
    height: 50%;
    z-index: 2;
    border: 6px solid var(--color-bone);
  }

  .story__years {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -28px;
    left: -28px;
    z-index: 3;
    background: var(--color-maroon);
    color: var(--color-bone);
    width: 180px;
    height: 180px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow:
      var(--shadow-deep),
      inset 0 0 0 4px var(--color-maroon),
      inset 0 0 0 5px var(--color-gold);
    transform: rotate(-6deg);
  }

  .story__years-num {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 3.8rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--color-bone);
  }

  .story__years-num::after {
    content: "+";
    font-size: 2rem;
    vertical-align: super;
    margin-left: 0.1rem;
    color: var(--color-gold-soft);
  }

  .story__years-label {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-gold-soft);
    margin: 0.4rem auto 0;
    max-width: 130px;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .story__content {
    padding-top: 1rem;
  }

  .story__title {
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0;
    max-width: 14ch;
  }

  .story__lead {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    max-width: 540px;
  }

  .story__columns {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    max-width: 580px;
  }

  .story__column {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
    column-gap: 1.25rem;
    row-gap: 0.5rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(26, 20, 16, 0.1);
  }

  .story__column-icon {
    grid-row: span 2;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(185, 145, 78, 0.12);
    color: var(--color-maroon);
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
  }

  .story__column h3 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .story__column p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .story__more {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-maroon);
    padding-bottom: 0.4rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-maroon);
    transition: gap 0.35s var(--easing);
  }

  .story__more:hover {
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .story__inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 4rem;
    }
    .story__visual {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 520px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
  }

  /* Tablet / iPad: place the badge on the centered image's bottom-left corner */
  @media (min-width: 561px) and (max-width: 1024px) {
    .story__years {
      width: 150px;
      height: 150px;
      bottom: -24px;
      left: -12px;
    }
    .story__years-num {
      font-size: 3rem;
    }
    .story__years-num::after {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .story__years {
      width: 130px;
      height: 130px;
      bottom: -18px;
      left: -8px;
    }
    .story__years-num {
      font-size: 2.4rem;
    }
    .story__years-num::after {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
    }
    .story__years-label {
      font-size: 0.5rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      margin-top: 0.3rem;
    }
  }
</style>
